  "57650c88-ddf0-4bbc-8ba4-f33aea87f6cc"],
 " for ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Inflate\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d80bfe5-5145-4bc2-bf25-14d069d45b83"],
 ". A Wolfram-model universe carries its rule and initial condition."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4b98ec1c-a09d-44bf-9136-531d21dae8df"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The options are those of ",
